a5825","maturity":"draft","page_type":"entity","path":"pages/entities/wrongstack-wrongstack-2e59994a5825.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":[],"title":"wrongstack/wrongstack","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:23:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_becf45a81eb741259614ff5c0eda45df"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0b7f8c828e6c72e4572b81b9ff45544d11fdf4d4672858519187ce2cec128475"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The kernel is described as four primitives — Container, Pipeline, EventBus, RunController — with extension points in registries and services bound through the Container."},{"claim_ids":["clm_257aeee85c267b770ac61cd8de75b161eab843b918df61e03490cfb92591335b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Every tool call passes a permission policy; project-root containment cannot be overridden by YOLO, absolute denies remain enforced, and destructive shell actions stay confirmable unless destructive YOLO is explicitly enabled."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3da31d32a5706a942ff6bee114483550d0a3272dd070bac941e6cf413967ad22"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A Director-led specialist fleet fans out subagents, each isolated with its own budget and JSONL transcript, coordinated over a project-wide mailbox with typed messages and live presence."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5a41a6a7ca5b89e8afc9cb1e587155e92d021febb56d34644e00c261e2e2fec4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"SAGE is project-local long-term memory backed by SQLite/FTS5 under .wrongstack/memories/, with typed knowledge, anchors to files/symbols/commands/commits, a knowledge graph, and auto-injection into context each turn."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9e8fd75ac6b39c23376b3569621e763a6256ae39f386f0248f0abd34194e7167"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: pnpm release:fast skips only the audit and instrumented-coverage gates that CI covers, and the release matrix verifies the packed providers package installs with npm 10."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b2c4784c44b87e58c723a87a7066d1dfe3d800b73949ca453d3040f5f24b93bd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: release verification uses pnpm release:check with 18 gates, root Vitest coverage thresholds are set (>=76% lines, >=75% functions, >=66% branches), and package-boundary rules are enforced by a dedicated architecture test."},{"claim_ids":["clm_bc84cf2441ef9b2710134c276d45208a21858275d524fac2592fa7de9744be3a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project requires Node.js >= 22.19.0 with pnpm (recommended) or npm, or Bun >= 1.3.10 as an alternative runtime; it is ESM-only with no CommonJS bundles."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d6e4cdf5f33b9cae66c30a2b682ab2d2a96090bfd10983dfb94e39f8b2d1cd79"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product offers six launch surfaces: a readline REPL, an Ink TUI behind --tui, a WebUI, SimpleUI, an Electron Desktop shell, and a cross-machine HQ dashboard."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f0378279ef38c0c12b39967a1709aaa13781c1f69fbe25c584ac0215fb3240ea"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The @wrongstack/bench package is described as a benchmark harness covering Aider polyglot and SWE-bench Verified."},{"claim_ids":["clm_fc3f6747e01874ea79dbda4991632607ddc3d7b348ba8d54909f805b65c6783f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Providers span multiple wire families including native Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, OpenAI-compatible, and OAuth adapters, with a catalog fetched from models.dev and one-command Ollama/vLLM/LM Studio local presets."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0b7f8c828e6c72e4572b81b9ff45544d11fdf4d4672858519187ce2cec128475","clm_257aeee85c267b770ac61cd8de75b161eab843b918df61e03490cfb92591335b","clm_3da31d32a5706a942ff6bee114483550d0a3272dd070bac941e6cf413967ad22","clm_5a41a6a7ca5b89e8afc9cb1e587155e92d021febb56d34644e00c261e2e2fec4","clm_9e8fd75ac6b39c23376b3569621e763a6256ae39f386f0248f0abd34194e7167","clm_b2c4784c44b87e58c723a87a7066d1dfe3d800b73949ca453d3040f5f24b93bd","clm_bc84cf2441ef9b2710134c276d45208a21858275d524fac2592fa7de9744be3a","clm_d6e4cdf5f33b9cae66c30a2b682ab2d2a96090bfd10983dfb94e39f8b2d1cd79","clm_f0378279ef38c0c12b39967a1709aaa13781c1f69fbe25c584ac0215fb3240ea","clm_fc3f6747e01874ea79dbda4991632607ddc3d7b348ba8d54909f805b65c6783f"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:23:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_becf45a81eb741259614ff5c0eda45df","id":"pg_43182783325d5bb7a5b